description = "Johto online questline, New Bark start on Gold/Silver, Gen2-aware PVP, GTS, and full Gen1Online features on Red/Blue/Yellow."

[features]
- Gold/Silver online start forced to NEW_BARK_TOWN
- Johto questline: Guide Mira, Sprout Tower Relay, Cherrygrove Signal
- Gen2 PVP: heldItem/happiness packing + same-generation gate
- Gen1 Kanto quests retained on Red/Blue/Yellow
